# Purpose: Save the three newest rollback events for release review.
# Inputs: deploy-history.log, oldest event first.
# Outputs: Newest-first rollback lines on stdout and rollback-review.txt.
accept deploy_history_path as text with default "deploy-history.log"
run cat with path deploy_history_path
pipe to grep with pattern "rollback"
pipe to sort with flags ["-r"]
pipe to head with lines 3
then save to "rollback-review.txt"
